--- [help] ---
help

Open Cube OS User-space Shell (ush) — built-in commands:

  cd [dir]        Change directory
  exit [code]     Exit shell
  help            Show this help
  export VAR=val  Set environment variable
  alias name=val  Set command alias
  unalias name    Remove alias
  env             Show environment variables
  pwd             Print working directory
  echo [text]     Print text to stdout
  history         Show command history
  cat <file>      Print file contents
  grep <pat> [f]  Filter lines matching pattern
  wc <file>       Count lines/words/chars
  head <file>     Print first 10 lines
  tail <file>     Print last 10 lines
  sort <file>     Sort lines alphabetically
  uniq <file>     Remove duplicate consecutive lines
  sed <script>    Stream editor (s/old/new/g, -n Np, Nd)
  awk '{print $N}' Print a field / NF / NR per line
  ls [dir]        List directory contents
  cp <src> <dst>  Copy file
  mv <src> <dst>  Move/rename file
  rm <file>       Remove file
  ln [-s] <a> <b> Hard link, or -s symlink (abs target)
  chmod <m> <f>   Change permission bits (octal)
  chown <u>:<g> <f> Change owner (numeric)
  mkdir <dir>     Create directory
  rmdir <dir>     Remove directory
  touch <file>    Create empty file / update timestamp
  stat <file>     Show file info
  uname           Print OS name
  free            Show memory info
  date            Show date/time
  df              Show disk usage
  du [dir]        Directory usage (recursive)
  ps              List all kernel tasks (TID/state/prio)
  kill <pid>      Kill a task
  top [-n N]      Snapshot + refresh process/memory stats
  ping <host>     ICMP echo via the kernel stack
  wget <h> [p] <path> Download via the kernel HTTP client
  netstat         Network statistics / sockets
  ifconfig        Network interface info
  nano <file>     nano-style editor (^O save ^X exit)
  vi <file>       Same editor, vi-compatible name
  jobs            List background jobs
  fg [job]        Bring job to foreground

  v2.0.0 service commands (SYS_L1SVC):
  rtc [uie|pie|alarm N]  CMOS RTC status + interrupt tests
  hpet [counter|oneshot|periodic|test]  HPET status + tests
  pmtimer [read|cal|wrap|test]  ACPI PM timer + calibration
  tsc [cal|delay N|test]  TSC reads + calibration + delay
  mount [type dev path]  List mounts or mount a filesystem
  mounts                 List VFS mount table
  umount <path>          Unmount a filesystem
  fatmount [dev path]    Mount FAT32 (default ata0 /mnt)
  fatstat                Show FAT32 stats
  tree [path]            Directory tree view
  dskstat / lsblk        Block devices + cache stats
  ahci / nvme / ata      Controller status
  parted [dev]           Partition table
  mkfs.fat32|exfat|ext4 <dev>  Format (confirm)
  fsck / sync            Filesystem check / flush cache
  abdisk / install / grub-install <dev>  Disk setup
  abcfg                  A/B grub.cfg preview
  *_test                 Block driver test suite
  <nicname> [/_test]     NIC status + tests (e1000e igb ixgbe
                         rtl8139/8168/8125/810x bcm57xx, other)
  wifi / bt              Wireless + bluetooth families
  sound / play / volume  Audio cards, playback, mixer
  hda/ac97/sb16/es1370/virtiosnd/usbaudio + _test variants
  update / checkupdate / rollback   A/B update family
  config list|get|set    System configuration store
  update_*_test          OTA test suite
  halt/shutdown/reboot   Power controls (same bodies as oc>)
  sleep <sec>            Delay N seconds
  suspend_test           S3 capability contract
  stats / uname / clear  Console + kernel counters
  lang [en|zh]           Output language
  chinese / font / encoding / ime [+ -test variants]
  touchpad / touchtest   Input subsystem
  uvc / uvctest          Camera (UVC devices + self test)
  scsi / scsitest        SCSI controllers + self test
  gameport / parallel / ir [+ *test]  Legacy port probes
  usb / usbdev [slot]    USB hosts, devices, descriptors
  usb_*_test             USB class driver test suite
  arp / route / ip       Neighbor, routing and address tables
  dhcp / dns / dnstest   Resolver + lease diagnostics
  firewall / nf_test     Ruleset + netfilter tests
  tcpstats / tcptest / tcpcc_test  TCP diagnostics
  lspci                  PCI device scan
  cryptotest / dhtest    Crypto self-tests (NIST + DH)

  Editing: Up/Down history, Left/Right/Home/End cursor, Del,
  Ctrl+A/E/U/K/W, Ctrl+C cancel, Tab completion

  Redirection:  > file   >> file   < file   | cmd


